From: Zaid <nottzaid@tutamail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:32:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] miles-bench checkpoint S12: all kept steps, lighting fix,
 instrumentation

VRAM reserve, geometry decompression fix, index cache (fail-fast), particle
batching, discard barriers, particle draw constants, lazy descriptor heaps,
dropdst page drops, sparse light grid and skinning buffer with larger initial
backing (5120 pages / 32 MiB), memtrace/frametrace/gputime/benchinput.
Fight bench on the SSD: 25.2 -> 42.3 fps (v13-S0 vs v13-S12).
